[{"key":"1oyz4vc0udsvv6","text":"Rooks take turns climbing, like a ladder. One guards a row, the other gives check!"},{"key":"0ro2pgr1nqz8x7","text":"The bishop lives on light squares, but the star is on a light square. Never!"},{"key":"0ev4ax40v0xykw","text":"The bishop and the star are both on light squares. She can get there!"},{"key":"0zdf7151l8o65r","text":"What does the bishop want? Keep your rook safe! Careful with checks."},{"key":"1jthxf314p8d5r","text":"Pin it! A pinned piece can't move without losing something bigger."},{"key":"04eodis0udevtk","text":"The queen attacks the king. That's check! He can still get away."},{"key":"046bde007uai4w","text":"The pawn attacks the king. That's check! He can still get away."},{"key":"16dfjef1khpuh9","text":"Every move must eat a snack! Eat them all with the knight."},{"key":"1pi56fy1764w5w","text":"Mate Hunt! Look at every check. One of them is checkmate!"},{"key":"0686qks107smge","text":"Detective Pip! Check, checkmate, stalemate, or all fine?"},{"key":"09volbo1aov36e","text":"Careful! The king could gobble your knight. Try again!"},{"key":"058mr55025vky7","text":"Careful! The king could gobble your queen. Try again!"},{"key":"1g04cjq1wom9ne","text":"Careful! The king could gobble your king. Try again!"},{"key":"1o7v5xn0y1wxdv","text":"That is the cookie! Tap YOUR pieces that can eat it."},{"key":"0dzn8g80m48nlc","text":"Oops, Shelly left a bishop alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"02ztep900oxnzd","text":"Oops, Shelly left a queen alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0wfbqv51qj9flx","text":"Oops, Bruno left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1gjm55e0ng2t08","text":"Your first checkmate! The king had nowhere to go."},{"key":"04qzvno0cua53e","text":"Oops, Fern left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1vvh8mt0dhjn09","text":"The knight gives check, but the king can escape."},{"key":"084tix51o73e27","text":"Oops, Tuck left a queen alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0k0k7jf1mn0v49","text":"Oops, Bruno left a king alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1vh3kbx0ojanjv","text":"Oops, Ember left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0xcdnes1skbxo2","text":"What does the knight want? Keep your rook safe!"},{"key":"0zpa6tf1r2hzb3","text":"Oops, Hop left a queen alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1cwal3c16116sg","text":"Oops, Fern left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"13e30e6090ste2","text":"The pawn gives check, but the king can escape."},{"key":"126p9d30an0r3t","text":"Think about how much candy each one is worth."},{"key":"14mcyix0o11zpt","text":"Your turn! Tap every square the rook can go."},{"key":"0vtepcg1r7rlow","text":"Friends are on two squares. Hop around them!"},{"key":"0fq0bwx176c5ab","text":"Bruno is napping, Olive will play instead."},{"key":"0l7tbsf1irqo39","text":"Find checkmate! Look at every check first."},{"key":"19237ej1289ieh","text":"The rook can eat enemies, but stops there."},{"key":"1700hvd1x11n7b","text":"Tuck's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"1tdsdq115gpz11","text":"The queen in the middle. So many squares!"},{"key":"1g3r1kd1d7ubpr","text":"The bishop has a pointy hat with a slit."},{"key":"1md8s5u1rxa2zk","text":"A knight in the middle has lots of hops!"},{"key":"00dxx3b1vj5zqx","text":"Hi! I'm Pip. Let's play chess together!"},{"key":"00blmkl07qgb7r","text":"First the letter a, then the number 5."},{"key":"04wdr070u81nfp","text":"First the letter b, then the number 2."},{"key":"1cqwf3q0u81nka","text":"First the letter b, then the number 7."},{"key":"0dlwd3a1gpmzs8","text":"First the letter c, then the number 4."},{"key":"0qyj2om0464a12","text":"First the letter d, then the number 1."},{"key":"0imrudh0464a5n","text":"First the letter d, then the number 6."},{"key":"036slmv0qnpmdl","text":"First the letter e, then the number 3."},{"key":"02nnzcg0qnpmi6","text":"First the letter e, then the number 8."},{"key":"0q3urlc1d5ayq4","text":"First the letter f, then the number 5."},{"key":"0jqvnj000ls8yy","text":"First the letter g, then the number 2."},{"key":"1axh1el00ls93j","text":"First the letter g, then the number 7."},{"key":"1657par0n3dlbh","text":"First the letter h, then the number 4."},{"key":"0l9cgf81c5k684","text":"Look for checks, captures and attacks!"},{"key":"0y56n7a02oruxg","text":"Ding ding! Your king can be captured!"},{"key":"0195o1j08b3iud","text":"You win 11, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"1889v250xge0u9","text":"Check means a piece attacks the king."},{"key":"0kvmpev0ju4o01","text":"Your pawn became a queen! Keep going!"},{"key":"09ll8nx1gjuk2b","text":"You win 0, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"11qhno00knm394","text":"You win 5, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"0aac1n9061ec5j","text":"Look at the king. Who can reach him?"},{"key":"0a3xks1098a09d","text":"One quick one from before. Let's go!"},{"key":"1o1j2gi02smrf0","text":"That's the bishop! Find the knight."},{"key":"0z4xbok1homlsk","text":"Letter first, then number. Go fast!"},{"key":"1svm27f0ybikt1","text":"Tap every square the bishop can go!"},{"key":"1c4w2or0rzkzlx","text":"That's the queen! Find the bishop."},{"key":"04piwsn0a5tif9","text":"That's the queen! Find the knight."},{"key":"0069pwg013pim0","text":"Hop made a queen first. Try again!"},{"key":"1xzp1160bibrim","text":"Tap every square the queen can go!"},{"key":"0er7kxg1ggrx3k","text":"That's the king! Find the bishop."},{"key":"16a3d0s1gb6rww","text":"That's the bishop! Find the king."},{"key":"1ymircv0xgl2gt","text":"That's the knight! Find the pawn."},{"key":"0u665a30fo7ao7","text":"Capture the Crown. knight's turn."},{"key":"014wkpt1640n89","text":"Tap every square the king can go!"},{"key":"0c446w20do0ak6","text":"That's the queen! Find the pawn."},{"key":"1t95n4u1760v2i","text":"Done. Try it yourself next time."},{"key":"0rtw09g1y97obe","text":"The rook can't reach the cookie."},{"key":"1o04blm1omgbh0","text":"That's the king! Find the king."},{"key":"081yz5u1lch1q0","text":"That's the rook! Find the rook."},{"key":"0eofi5115smkgx","text":"The queen wears a pointy crown."},{"key":"1mk8vfv1ef093p","text":"Checkmate in 10 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"01hcxxc151xxy2","text":"Checkmate in 15 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"1iyl2xy1uuu35g","text":"Mate in one: check every check."},{"key":"0anh48716wksi9","text":"Pawn war board. knight's turn."},{"key":"0pulya20njoazq","text":"Checkmate in 2 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"0klo7il0e6lzu3","text":"Checkmate in 7 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"1nikz061v9sh1u","text":"Good check. Find a safer move."},{"key":"0hvscgh1sfmjmj","text":"Tap a piece, then its square."},{"key":"1f79u1s1vkgk4s","text":"The arrows show the munchers!"},{"key":"0uchs7a0j897mo","text":"Checkmate with king and queen"},{"key":"0wnfytw1e4q75u","text":"Nobody can move. It's a tie!"},{"key":"1xqq6ks0cebhmy","text":"Only 10! You found them all!"},{"key":"1kmdds50tf9zxr","text":"Only 15! You found them all!"},{"key":"0ouy64v1igsev1","text":"Where is the queen? Tap it!"},{"key":"1k5lygf1rg3ked","text":"The bishop was guarding it!"},{"key":"0nto8um1yxtkws","text":"Only 3! You found them all!"},{"key":"12x7va10gxo18h","text":"Only 8! You found them all!"},{"key":"1hm67u20jxo4z4","text":"Check! The king has to run."},{"key":"0xyajwt0n6k759","text":"You won! Brilliant playing!"},{"key":"1fgfkfp0kz1881","text":"14 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"1iifkxi0bl9jis","text":"The bishop can't go there."},{"key":"0hyctm80z5dmki","text":"Shelly made a queen first."},{"key":"05i3kgn07c4qqx","text":"Your first capture! Chomp!"},{"key":"03wwzsc0r5ghri","text":"2 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"00flkrh0sc9ddd","text":"5 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"1ck4pg10rpmjyh","text":"The king was guarding it!"},{"key":"0pvycyx09p0rxp","text":"The queen can't go there."},{"key":"0kylsf00um5dp8","text":"Ember made a queen first."},{"key":"00q1ae00ew580q","text":"Win a game against knight"},{"key":"0h8g5851d3prtx","text":"The pawn can't go there."},{"key":"1irba650f2w9sd","text":"Where can the bishop go?"},{"key":"1wmc1r20lxu18u","text":"Checkmate with two rooks"},{"key":"00o392q0qtcc92","text":"11 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"1sswrba0c0v4i2","text":"15 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"17aqhm50muxw6h","text":"It's a tie! Good fight."},{"key":"18sawq01sp0mh2","text":"Where can the queen go?"},{"key":"0ornt6415w53qo","text":"Win a game against rook"},{"key":"11ccbbq05t1w82","text":"Yes! That's the queen!"},{"key":"1dih7wz0c8vxbp","text":"1 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"1ionepw0t9ufmi","text":"6 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"0oeowxv0d2t07v","text":"Checkmate in 11 moves."},{"key":"0bw8dl80a1jbom","text":"Here are some of them."},{"key":"0yquhj212lysou","text":"Tuck moved! Your turn."},{"key":"0ql7p2m1tl793y","text":"Where can the pawn go?"},{"key":"0pyke4f0osde8x","text":"Hi queen! Tap to play."},{"key":"0oj96bu1a94adq","text":"Checkmate in 5 moves."},{"key":"14rtzu40zbrh3m","text":"Yes! The queen moved!"},{"key":"1iukuw31fyzq2r","text":"Good try! Play again?"},{"key":"04rt9ci1u2t9ho","text":"Hi king! Tap to play."},{"key":"1oygey41xla67c","text":"Tap 11 light squares"},{"key":"1rblox71rfwiej","text":"Tap 14 light squares"},{"key":"0dk9vwr1812ftx","text":"It jumped like this!"},{"key":"02nv2g2188zjde","text":"Shelly won this one."},{"key":"02wwpek0nmrj2w","text":"Tap 2 light squares"},{"key":"04ylysb112642l","text":"Tap 7 light squares"},{"key":"0dwokz30js9kkz","text":"Tap 12 dark squares"},{"key":"03fog481tkes5c","text":"This is the knight!"},{"key":"1r5qko91mno1vj","text":"Here is the e road."},{"key":"0f5ybn614qbv5g","text":"The queen was here!"},{"key":"1u9t4qw0vifntg","text":"Capture en passant."},{"key":"1ml312m0dthvi0","text":"Stuck! It's a tie."},{"key":"020t1uk1db135u","text":"Tap 2 dark squares"},{"key":"0dt4bv11oh4bqf","text":"Tap 7 dark squares"},{"key":"0ix8bsb0ubr0e1","text":"Eat this one next!"},{"key":"1bznwjb1f4x1f5","text":"It came from here!"},{"key":"0ezi1vs1gm8tiy","text":"Who can take back?"},{"key":"0dqsij21boozk8","text":"Look around here!"},{"key":"1a42kp41yac44w","text":"Promote the 